{"_id":"bc2738101a04dabe","name":"Zeni","type":"loot","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/loot.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Ƶeni is a currency that is given value by the Dragon World at large and various multi-universal  businesses. Not all planets and star systems use this currency but most are willing to convert with the following exchange rate:</p>\n<h5>Ƶeni Conversion</h5>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"text-align:left\">Currency</th>\n  <th style=\"text-align:left\">Ƶ</th>\n  <th style=\"text-align:center\">CP</th>\n  <th style=\"text-align:center\">SP</th>\n  <th style=\"text-align:center\">EP</th>\n  <th style=\"text-align:center\">GP</th>\n  <th style=\"text-align:center\">PP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Ƶeni (Ƶ)</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">1</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/100</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/1,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/5,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/10,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/100,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Copper (CP)</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">100</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/10</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/50</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/100</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/1,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Silver (SP)</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">1,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">10</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/5</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/10</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Electrum</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">5,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">50</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">5</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/2</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Gold (GP)</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">10,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">100</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">10</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">Platinum (PP)</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:left\">100,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1,000</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">100</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">20</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">10</td>\n  <td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"zeni","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":0,"denomination":"zeni"},"rarity":"","type":{"value":"","subtype":""}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9207,"endLine":9219},"contentCategory":"equipment"}}}
{"_id":"bc5b8fc6241d5946","name":"Ultra Divine Water","type":"equipment","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/equipment.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you drink this seemingly normal water you immedietly fall unconcious and begin making death saving throws. If you survive and stabalize yourself naturally then you gain 2 Training Boons.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ultra-divine-water","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":0,"denomination":"zeni"},"rarity":"","type":{"value":"","subtype":""}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9934,"endLine":9936},"contentCategory":"equipment"}}}
