{"_id":"c955d21a62ce9c62","name":"Red Star Balls","type":"equipment","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/equipment.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Red Star Dragon Balls</em> are the most commonly found kind of <strong>Dragon Balls.</strong> A set of <em>Red Star Dragon Balls</em> can be used a number of times equal to their maker's <em>Proficiency Bonus</em> before they become inert or create <em>Shadow Dragons</em> to expel the negative energy. A set of <em>Red Star Dragon Balls</em> can create one of two kinds of <strong>Wishing Dragons</strong>, listed below:</p>\n<h5>Gift Dragon</h5>\n<p><em>Gift</em> are true wish granters and as such are heavily tied to the power of their creator, being unable to pull off feats beyond them. <em>Gift Dragons</em> will attempt to satisfy a wish to the best of their abilities have even been known to warn others of possible consequences to their wish.</p>\n<h5>Deal Dragon</h5>\n<p><em>Deal Dragons</em> are much more rare, even among <strong>Wishing Dragons</strong>, allowing them to take something they view as\nan equal deal to perform greater wishes than <em>Gift Dragons</em>. <em>Deal Dragons</em> are crafty and almost never tell the user the <em>complete</em> truth in regards to the cost, such as telling the user what they are spending but neglecting to say how <em><strong>MUCH</strong></em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"red-star-balls","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":0,"denomination":"zeni"},"rarity":"","type":{"value":"","subtype":""}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":10037,"endLine":10050},"contentCategory":"equipment"}}}
{"_id":"ca109d0236dfb902","name":"Greataxe","type":"weapon","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/weapon.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 300,000 Zeni | <strong>Damage:</strong> 1d12 Slashing | <strong>Weapon Properties:</strong> Heavy, Two-Handed</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"greataxe","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"quantity":1,"weight":{"value":0,"units":"lb"},"price":{"value":300000,"denomination":"zeni"},"rarity":"","type":{"value":"","subtype":""}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":9488,"endLine":9507},"contentCategory":"equipment"}}}
